  "generated_text": "1. **Start with the given equations:**\n   \\[\n   a + b + c = 2\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   a^2 + b^2 + c^2 = 12\n   \\]\n\n2. **Square the first equation:**\n   \\[\n   (a + b + c)^2 = 2^2\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   a^2 + b^2 + c^2 + 2(ab + bc + ca) = 4\n   \\]\n\n3. **Substitute the second equation into the squared equation:**\n   \\[\n   12 + 2(ab + bc + ca) = 4\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   2(ab + bc + ca) = -8\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   ab + bc + ca = -4\n   \\]\n\n4. **Consider the expression for $c$:**\n   \\[\n   c = \\frac{2 - a - b}{1}\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   c = 2 - a - b\n   \\]\n\n5. **Analyze the expression for $c$:**\n   \\[\n   c = 2 - a - b\n   \\",
